We have $h=\frac{1}{2}{g t^2}^2$ and $h+400=\frac{1}{2} g(t+4)^2$.
Subtracting we get $400=8 \mathrm{ g}+4 \mathrm{gt} 
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \mathrm{t}=8 \mathrm{sec} \\
